  "source": {
    "design": "Outage Premium (ADR 0054): calm white surfaces in three greys, near-black ink in three steps, hairline borders, one blue (#1b6ef3, the icon's blue), Inter (OFL) on the web and Roboto on Android, an 8-point spacing scale, rounded 12/16/24 corners, soft layered shadows, glass panels over the map.",
    "states": "The four power states, tuned to read on white and on the map: green on, amber maybe, red out, teal back (so 'back' never reads as the app's blue). Map colours are the fills of the see-through hex layer (about 32%)."
